            "text": "No single brand wins every year or every style. For reliability, choose a simple layout from a brand with strong local service: GE, Whirlpool, Amana and Frigidaire top-freezers are the low-risk choices, and LG backs its inverter compressor with a long parts warranty. Our top pick is the GE GTE18GTNRWW, a plain top-freezer with no ice maker or dispenser."
