          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The most reliable refrigerator brands are the ones that still sell simple refrigerators and stand behind them with parts and service. GE, Whirlpool, Amana and Frigidaire top-freezers are the low-risk choices; LG adds a long compressor warranty; Bosch is the reliability-minded way to go counter-depth.
          </p>
